@startuml
title OaK detailed internal-process view

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor World as W

package "Core AoK agent (Sutton naming)" {
  [Perception] as Perception
  [State] as State
  [Reactive Policy] as ReactivePolicy
  [Value Function] as ValueFunction
  [Transition Model] as TransitionModel
}

package "Detailed internal OaK mechanisms" {
  [Feature Construction] as FeatureConstruction
  [SubTask] as SubTask
  [Option] as OptionLearner
  [Option Model] as OptionModelLearner
  [Planning] as Planning
  [Utility Assessor] as UtilityAssessor
  [Curator] as Curator
  [Option Keyboard\n(optional)] as OptionKeyboard
  [Meta Step-Size Learner] as MetaStepSizeLearner
}

W --> Perception : observation, reward, last action
Perception --> State : produces
State --> ReactivePolicy : current state
State --> ValueFunction : current state
State --> TransitionModel : current state
ReactivePolicy --> W : action
ValueFunction --> ReactivePolicy : learning signal
TransitionModel --> ReactivePolicy : planning signal
TransitionModel --> ValueFunction : simulated consequences

State ..> FeatureConstruction : interesting features
FeatureConstruction ..> SubTask : candidate features
SubTask ..> OptionLearner : reward-respecting subtask
OptionLearner ..> OptionModelLearner : learned option
OptionModelLearner ..> TransitionModel : option model
TransitionModel ..> Planning : predictive rollouts
Planning ..> ValueFunction : value targets
Planning ..> ReactivePolicy : policy targets

MetaStepSizeLearner --> Perception : per-weight step sizes
MetaStepSizeLearner --> ReactivePolicy : per-weight step sizes
MetaStepSizeLearner --> ValueFunction : per-weight step sizes
MetaStepSizeLearner --> TransitionModel : per-weight step sizes

FeatureConstruction --> UtilityAssessor : feature usage
OptionLearner --> UtilityAssessor : option usage
TransitionModel --> UtilityAssessor : planning utility
Planning --> UtilityAssessor : search statistics
UtilityAssessor --> Curator : utility scores
Curator --> FeatureConstruction : prune / replace
Curator --> OptionLearner : drop options
Curator --> OptionModelLearner : drop option models

FeatureConstruction --> OptionKeyboard : feature keys
OptionLearner --> OptionKeyboard : basis options
OptionKeyboard --> ReactivePolicy : composed option descriptor

@enduml
